---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout basePath="/v2" title="How It Works — Ask Astro Raja">
  
  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-light-bg relative overflow-hidden text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative z-10">
      <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">✦ The Process</div>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.1] mb-6 text-brand-navy">
        From your details <br />
        <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">to your report</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-brand-text max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Eight inputs. One AI engine. A full Vedic guidance report in under five minutes. Here is exactly what happens at each step — and why each question matters.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FULL PROCESS -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-20">
      <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">Step by Step</div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy">The full <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">process</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-16">
      
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-16 items-start border-b border-brand-border pb-16">
        <div class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-serif text-brand-saffron/30 font-light leading-none">01</div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-xs">Your Cosmic Identity</div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">Enter Your Name, Raasi, Lagnam & Nakshatra</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">These four fields are the foundation of your entire reading. In Vedic astrology, your Raasi (Moon Sign) governs your emotional nature and inner world. Your Lagnam (Ascendant) reveals how you approach the world outwardly — your personality, physicality, and first impressions. Your Nakshatra (Birth Star) is the most precise indicator of all — a 27-fold division of the zodiac that reveals your core character, karmic tendencies, and life themes with remarkable accuracy.</p>
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted mb-8 leading-relaxed">You do not need your exact birth time to use this tool. If you already know your Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra from a previous reading or family record, simply enter them. If you do not, our Raasi Guide page can help you find them.</p>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Name</div>
              <div class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-lg">Priya Nandakumar</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Raasi (Moon Sign)</div>
              <div class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-lg">Meenam</div>
              <div class="text-brand-text-muted text-xs">மீனம்</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Lagnam (Ascendant)</div>
              <div class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-lg">Thulam</div>
              <div class="text-brand-text-muted text-xs">துலாம்</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Nakshatra (Birth Star)</div>
              <div class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-lg">Revathi</div>
              <div class="text-brand-text-muted text-xs">4th Padam</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-16 items-start border-b border-brand-border pb-16">
        <div class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-serif text-brand-saffron/30 font-light leading-none">02</div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-xs">Four Intake Questions</div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">Tell Us About Your Life Right Now</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted mb-8 leading-relaxed">The same Raasi and Nakshatra can manifest very differently depending on where you are in life. A student asking about career direction needs different guidance than a 40-year-old professional feeling stuck, even if they share the same birth star. These four questions let the AI understand your actual context — not a generic snapshot.</p>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Question 1</div>
              <div class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-lg mb-4">Current Struggles</div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="bg-brand-saffron text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Career confusion</span>
                <span class="bg-brand-saffron text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Overthinking</span>
                <span class="bg-brand-saffron/10 text-brand-navy text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-saffron/20">Money / Debt</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Question 2</div>
              <div class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-lg mb-4">Daily Life</div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="bg-brand-saffron text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Student</span>
                <span class="bg-brand-saffron/10 text-brand-navy text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-saffron/20">Office job</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-16 items-start border-b border-brand-border pb-16">
        <div class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-serif text-brand-saffron/30 font-light leading-none">03</div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-xs">AI Generation</div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">Your Inputs Meet the Vedic Engine</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">All eight inputs — your name, Raasi, Lagnam, Nakshatra, and four answers — are sent together to our AI engine. The engine has been trained on a deeply crafted Vedic astrology system built by our founder over months of study. It applies authentic Vedic principles to your specific combination, not a generalised horoscope.</p>
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">This process takes approximately 30 to 60 seconds. During this time, the AI is composing a structured, multi-section report that would take a human astrologer an hour or more to produce by hand.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-serif text-brand-saffron/30 font-light leading-none">04</div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-xs">Your Report</div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">Read, Save & Download</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Your report is displayed immediately in your browser — no account, no login required. Read it in full, then download it as a PDF to keep, print, or share with family. Or download as a Word document if you want to make personal notes alongside the guidance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- REPORT ANATOMY -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-saffron/5 border-y border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">Inside the Report</div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-16">What your report <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">contains</span></h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
        <!-- Mockup -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
          <div class="bg-brand-navy p-6 md:p-8 border-b-4 border-brand-saffron">
            <div class="text-[9px] tracking-widest uppercase text-white/40 mb-2">Personal Vedic Report</div>
            <div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Priya Nandakumar</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-white/70">Meenam · Thulam Lagnam · Revathi Nakshatra</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-0">
            <div class="p-6 md:p-8 border-b border-brand-border">
              <div class="text-[9px] font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-saffron mb-2">Core Strengths</div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-border rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-brand-navy">Deep empathy</span>
                <span class="bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-border rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-brand-navy">Intuitive thinking</span>
                <span class="bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-border rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-brand-navy">Creative vision</span>
                <span class="bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-border rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-brand-navy">Spiritual depth</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 md:p-8 border-b border-brand-border">
              <div class="text-[9px] font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-saffron mb-2">Nakshatra Character</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Your Revathi Nakshatra, ruled by Pushan — the divine shepherd — gives you a natural pull towards guiding and nurturing others...</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 md:p-8 border-b border-brand-border relative">
              <div class="text-[9px] font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-saffron mb-2">Career Guidance</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed blur-[3px] select-none">The next 14 months carry a powerful shift for Meenam Raasi. This window is particularly suited to establishing roots in creative or helping professions. Your Lagnam lord Venus is transiting into a favourable position...</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 md:p-8 relative">
              <div class="text-[9px] font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-saffron mb-2">Spiritual Remedies</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed blur-[3px] select-none">Given your devotional orientation and Revathi Nakshatra, the following practices align naturally with your energy...</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sections List -->
        <div>
          <ul class="space-y-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 flex-shrink-0 bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-border rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg text-brand-navy">⚡</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1">Core Strengths & Shadow Traits</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Your Nakshatra's natural gifts — and the shadow patterns that tend to hold people with your combination back. Knowing both is what makes this actionable.</div>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 flex-shrink-0 bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-border rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg text-brand-navy">☽</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1">Nakshatra Character Analysis</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">A deep reading of your birth star — its ruling deity, planet, elemental nature, and what it reveals about your karmic purpose and natural way of being in the world.</div>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 flex-shrink-0 bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-border rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg text-brand-navy">◎</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1">Career & Life Path Guidance</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Specific to your struggle selections and daily life. Students get different guidance than entrepreneurs. Each path recommendation is grounded in your Lagnam's approach to ambition and effort.</div>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 flex-shrink-0 bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-border rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg text-brand-navy">♡</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1">Relationship & Emotional Patterns</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">How your Raasi and Lagnam interact in close relationships — your attachment style, communication tendencies, and what you need from a partner or family dynamic.</div>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 flex-shrink-0 bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-border rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg text-brand-navy">🌿</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1">Spiritual Remedies & Practices</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Matched to your spiritual orientation. Devotional users receive temple and prayer recommendations. Practical users receive grounded daily habits. No one-size-fits-all rituals.</div>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 flex-shrink-0 bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-border rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg text-brand-navy">→</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-1">Monthly Focus & Action Steps</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Concrete guidance for the next 30 to 90 days — broken into specific areas to focus on, actions to take, and patterns to watch out for based on your current Dasha period.</div>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DOWNLOAD OPTIONS -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">Export Options</div>
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">Download as <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">PDF or Word</span></h2>
    <p class="text-brand-text-muted mb-12">Once your report is generated, choose the format that works best for how you plan to use it.</p>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-10 bg-white flex flex-col">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📄</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">PDF Download</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">A beautifully formatted, print-ready PDF with full branding and report structure. Looks polished whether read on a phone, a tablet, or printed on paper.</p>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-saffron font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Best for</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Sharing with parents or family · Printing and keeping · Reading on mobile · Sending via WhatsApp</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-10 bg-white flex flex-col">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📝</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">Word Document</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">A fully editable .docx file you can open in Microsoft Word, Google Docs, or any word processor. Add your own notes, highlight sections, or edit the report for personal use.</p>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-saffron font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Best for</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed">Adding personal notes · Sharing with a counsellor · Referencing over time · Editing for your own journal</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIMELINE -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-navy">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">Time to Complete</div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-16 font-light">Done in under <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">five minutes</span></h2>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row relative gap-8 md:gap-0">
        <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-7 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-white/10"></div>
        
        <div class="flex-1 text-center px-4 relative">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-saffron/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-saffron relative z-10 mb-4">01</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-saffron/70 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">~60 sec</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed">Enter name, Raasi, Lagnam & Nakshatra</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 text-center px-4 relative">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-saffron/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-saffron relative z-10 mb-4">02</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-saffron/70 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">~90 sec</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed">Answer 4 intake questions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 text-center px-4 relative">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-saffron/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-saffron relative z-10 mb-4">03</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-saffron/70 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">~60 sec</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed">AI generates your full report</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 text-center px-4 relative">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-brand-saffron/10 border border-brand-saffron/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-saffron relative z-10 mb-4">04</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-saffron/70 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Instant</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed">Read and download your report</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-navy text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Ready to begin?<br/><span class="text-brand-saffron italic">It takes five minutes.</span></h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-brand-saffron/80 mb-10">Your Raasi, Lagnam and Nakshatra are waiting to speak.</p>
      <a href="/v2/get-reading" class="inline-block px-10 py-4 bg-brand-saffron text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-brand-saffron-dark transition-colors shadow-lg">
        Begin My Reading — Free
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
